 "text": "County Treasurer - YORK COUNTY, NEBRASKA\n{logo}\n-->\nYORK COUNTY, NEBRASKA\nHome\nAging Services\nCourthouse\nJustice\nPublic Safety\nRoads Department\nPublic Transportation\nWeed Department\nEmployment\nPress Releases\nContact\nCounty Treasurer in York County, Nebraska\n|\nMegan Williams\nCounty Treasurer\nmwilliams@yorkcountyne.gov\n​(402) 362- 4929 ext. 7\n|\n510 N. Lincoln Avenue - 1st Floor\n​York, NE 68467\nFax: (402) 362-1908\nMonday - Friday: 8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m.\n|\n|\nMichelle Steiger\nDeputy County Treasurer\n|\n​Duties of the County Treasurer: To collect all revenues for the County\nTo bill and collect all real estate and personal property taxes in the County\nTo issue motor vehicle titles\nTo register all motor vehicles with tax situs in the County\nTo issue driver licenses, CDL's, learner permits, ID cards, school permits, etc.\nTo disburse collections to the proper political subdivisions\nTo register motor boats\nTo register snowmobiles\n|\nPay Taxes Online\nDMV / Driver's Examiner\nOrder Specialty Plates\n|\nTax Sale Information Information on Purchasing.PDF\nW9 Form.PDF\nTax Sale Registration.PDF\n2024 Advertising List.PDF ​\nTax Sale List.PDF\nFor information on the DMV or the Driver's Examiner, please click HERE\nYork County, Nebraska\nServing the citizens of central Nebraska since 1870\nYork County Courthouse\n510 N Lincoln Ave, York, NE 68467\nYork County Highway Department\n722 E. 25th Street, York, NE 68467\n|\nCounty Offices\n​Monday–Friday - 8:00am-5:00pm\nCourt System\nMonday–Friday - 8:00am-12:00pm & 1:00pm-5:00pm\nRoads Department\n(April - October) Monday–Thursday 7:00am-5:30pm\n(November - March) Monday–Friday 7:00am-3:30pm ​\n|\nPrivacy Policy | Accessibility | Site hosted by Eckert Digital\nHome\nAging Services\nCourthouse\nCounty Assessor\nCounty Board\nCounty Clerk\nCounty Treasurer\nDMV\nElections\nGeneral Assistance\nRegister of Deeds\nSurveyor\nVeterans Services\nZoning\nJustice\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Court\nChild 